        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The construct breathes in one of two ways, then can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Flame**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, evocation, fire\n\nA blast of flame deals 15d10 fire damage to all creatures in a 60-foot cone (45 basic Reflex save). This fire damage does not harm objects or constructs.\n- **Weakening Gas**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, necromancy\n\nA cloud of gold-flecked gas forces each creature in a 60-foot cone to attempt a 45 Fortitude save; the effect lasts 1 minute.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is enfeebled 2.\n- **Failure:** The creature is enfeebled 5.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is enfeebled 8."
            },
